  m_text: '"This game was created as part of the LoGaCulture project by Bournemouth
    University, University of Southampton, and University of Bristol, alongside the
    National Trust, and funded by the UKRI and European Commission.



    Please
    play safely, respect the historic environment, and be mindful of others - do
    not use your device near the roads, cross carefully, be careful walking on uneven
    ground, and ensure that your play does not alarm livestock or disturb people
    enjoying Avebury around you.



    Note that this game may present a historical
    understanding of the nature and history of the Avebury site, but as part of a
    fictional story. The factual history of ancient sites is often unclear and ambiguous.



    This
    game may log anonymous data with regards to your usage, but not personal or identifiable
    information. By playing this game you consent to this data being used anonymously
    for research purposes - more information on the LoGaCulture research project
    at Avebury can be found here: https://logaculture.eu/case-study-1/.'
